  abstract={In order to improve low efficiency conducted in text classification and measuring similarity using vector space model for representing text. This paper proposed a method for reducing feature items of feature vector based on thesaurus. It used semantic relation of thesaurus such as Y, D, F, S, C symbol to merge and reconstruct the feature items. And then the method was applied to formal concept analysis FCA. The experimental results show that the method has better effective on reducing attributes of formal context, and can improve the time efficiency of construction of concept lattice.},
